  "reasoning": "The defendant, Yang, used his position to embe a treasurer and director to repeatedly submit false expense reports and divert public funds, amounting to 196,000 yuan, which fits the crime of 职务侵占 (occupying public funds). Additionally, he misappropriated disaster relief donations (specific earmarked funds) for personal and unrelated expenses, totaling 132,000 yuan, which matches the crime of 挪用特定款物 (misappropriation of specific funds). Both offenses are distinct and should be charged together.",
